-- expect-command: check
-- expect-status: fail
-- expect-stderr: return type mismatch: function `first_or_zero` expects `String` but expression has `Int`
-- expect-stderr: return type mismatch: function `prefixed` expects `Int` but expression has `String`

-- An argument of unknown type takes the type of the other one.
> first_or_zero(xs) -> String { head(concat([0], xs)) }
> prefixed(s) -> Int { concat("a", s) }
